{
  "_comment": "Template for appsettings.Local.json - the real, per-install secrets file. Copy this to appsettings.Local.json in the same folder (next to the .exe) and fill in real values for this specific client's deployment. appsettings.Local.json is git-ignored and must never be committed - it's the only place real credentials live. Applies in every environment (Development and Production alike) and overrides anything set in appsettings.json / appsettings.{Environment}.json.",
